WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.602
-Now, Tom, you have
a bit of a reputation

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:05.671
for accidentally giving away
spoilers for your movies,

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:09.308
so I thought it would be fun
to turn that skill into a game.

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:12.077
It is time for
"Instant Spoilers."

00:00:12.077 --> 00:00:16.516
♪ -Instant spoilers,
instant spoilers ♪

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.618
-Alright. Now, we each
have a stack of cards

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.286
with names of movies on them.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.221
When it's your turn,
you draw a card

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:24.257
and have to shout out
a spoiler for that movie.

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.292
The other person
tries to guess the movie

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.395
based on only the spoiler.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:29.896
The goal is
to guess as many movies

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.897
as possible
before the timer runs out.

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:33.666
We're playing as a team.
You ready for this?

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.668
-Okay. Yes, let's do this.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:39.271
-Tom, since you are the spoiler
expert, you'll guess first.

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:40.740
Let's get 30 seconds
on the clock.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.774
Let's get as many as we can.

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:44.344 line:0%
Ready? And go.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.344 line:0%
-"Citizen Kane."

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:46.913 line:0%
-Oh, wait.
-Wait. What?

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.248 line:0%
-What?
-Oh, hang on a minute.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:50.683
[ Buzzer ]
-Wait, you're going first?

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.385
-I thought you said
I was going first,

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.087
and then I started to read it
out, but then I realized

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.822
I just read out
the title of the film.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:57.023
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.724
-I just shouted out
"Citizen Kane."

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:00.727
That's not how it works.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.662
-No, you have to
give the spoiler.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.631
-Right.
-The way the game --

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.399
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.701
The game's already --
So already you've messed it up.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.070
But, yes, the spoiler would be
"Rosebud" probably.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.205
But, yes, correct.
That's it.

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:15.141
But now I will --
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.109
Okay, no, so here's
what's gonna happen.

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:22.047
Now I'm going to try to read
spoilers from my movies

00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:23.049
and you're gonna
guess the title.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.450
-Okay.
-Alright. Here we go.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.852
-I'm ready, I'm ready,
I'm ready, I'm ready, I'm ready.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.287
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.723 line:0%
Ready? And go.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.525 line:0%
"Luke, I am your father."

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.193 line:0%
-"Star Wars."
[ Ding! ]

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:35.261 line:0%
-The other one.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:38.097 line:0%
-The -- That is "Star Wars,"
isn't it?

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:39.932 line:0%
I don't know.
-Sure.

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:40.966 line:0%
-"Empire Strikes Back."

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:42.435 line:0%
-Yeah.
[ Ding! ]

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.871 line:0%
They did need a bigger boat.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.239 line:0%
-"Jaws."
[ Ding! ]

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.841 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:50.242 line:0%
He was dead the whole time.

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:51.444 line:0%
-"The Sixth Sense."

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.845 line:0%
-Yeah.
[ Ding! ]

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:55.548 line:0%
Oh, oh, Brad Pitt wasn't real.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:56.549 line:0%
-"Fight Club."

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:57.383 line:0%
-Yeah.
[ Ding! ]

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.752 line:0%
Uh, uh, uh, s--

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:01.887 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:05.391 line:0%
I almost said Superman.
-What happened?

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.660 line:0%
-Well, I freaked out because it
was "Spider-Man: Homecoming,"

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.429 line:0%
so it was you and I go --
-Oh.

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.030 line:0%
-They tried to mess with me.
-I'm in that one.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.165 line:0%
I'm in that one.
I should have got that one.

00:02:13.165 --> 00:02:16.168 line:0%
-I was going to say "Superman."

00:02:16.168 --> 00:02:19.071 line:0%
-Big clue before we get started,
Jimmy.

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:20.740 line:0%
My first one is "Citizen Kane,"
just so you know.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.776 line:0%
-We already got "Citizen Kane."
Oh, my gosh.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:26.045 line:0%
That one's already out.
But I'm good at this.

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:29.648 line:0%
Ready? You got four.
I'm gonna get four as well.

00:02:29.648 --> 00:02:30.984 line:0%
Here we go. Ready?
-Okay.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:33.419 line:0%
-On your mark, get set, go.

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:36.956 line:0%
-The aliens are
allergic to water.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:39.925 line:0%
No? Okay.
-"Caddyshack."

00:02:39.925 --> 00:02:42.028 line:0%
-She fakes her death
and framed her husband.

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:43.296 line:0%
David Fitzgerald.
-"Gone Girl."

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:44.564 line:0%
[ Ding! ]

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:46.765 line:0%
-The top never stops spinning.
DiCaprio.

00:02:46.765 --> 00:02:48.268 line:0%
-Oh, yeah, "Inception."
[ Ding! ]

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:49.602 line:0%
-Yes.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.604 line:0%
I'm in it and I turn to dust.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:52.638 line:0%
-"Avengers"?

00:02:52.638 --> 00:02:54.707 line:0%
-Um, yes.
[ Ding! ]

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.275 line:0%
They never actually
made it to the moon.

00:02:56.275 --> 00:02:57.710 line:0%
"Houston, we have a problem."

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.013 line:0%
-"Apollo 19"?
-No.

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:02.414 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]
-8? "Apollo 7"?

00:03:02.414 --> 00:03:03.882 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:03.882 --> 00:03:05.251 line:0%
-I'll give you that.
I'll give you that.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.453 line:0%
"Apollo 13."
-13.

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.054
What did I say, 17?

00:03:09.054 --> 00:03:11.190
-19 and 8.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:15.727
-Well, "Apollo 19" was --
The script was amazing.

00:03:15.727 --> 00:03:21.067
And they never -- they never
made it or released it.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.602
But you know what?
They should've. Alright.

00:03:23.602 --> 00:03:24.871
-They should have done it.

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:26.906
Maybe me and you could make
that film together.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:28.741
-You know, it's fantasy.

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:30.209
That's the movie business.

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:32.611
It's entertainment, so --
-Love it.

00:03:32.611 --> 00:03:34.080
-For this last round,
we're going to see

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.381
how many we can get together.

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:37.249
We're going to take turns
drawing cards and guessing.

00:03:37.249 --> 00:03:39.218
Alright?
We'll see how fast we can go.

00:03:39.218 --> 00:03:43.089
Now, this time you speak first
and I will guess.

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:44.557
-Okay, okay.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:47.125 line:0%
-On your mark. Get set, go.

00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:49.428 line:0%
-It's a murder mystery film
and Chris Evans did it.

00:03:49.428 --> 00:03:50.729 line:0%
-Oh, yeah. "Knives Out."

00:03:50.729 --> 00:03:51.597 line:0%
[ Ding! ]
-Yes.

00:03:51.597 --> 00:03:53.432 line:0%
-Okay. Doo, doo, doo.

00:03:53.432 --> 00:03:57.637 line:0%
Mr. Orange is the rat.

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:59.171 line:0%
Quentin Tarantino.

00:03:59.171 --> 00:04:01.641 line:0%
-Uh...
-Yeah.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:03.309 line:0%
-I don't know. I don't know.
-Pass. You go.

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:06.078 line:0%
-"What's in the box?!
What's in the box?!"

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:07.179 line:0%
-Oh, "Seven," "Seven," "Seven"!
[ Ding! ]

00:04:07.179 --> 00:04:09.716 line:0%
-Yes.
-A theme park for dinosaurs.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:12.318 line:0%
-"Jurassic Park"!
-Yeah.

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:14.654 line:0%
-He keeps his dead mother
in a rocking chair.

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:16.089 line:0%
-"Psycho."
[ Ding! ]

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:18.024 line:0%
She kills Bill!
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:19.759 line:0%
She kills Bill.
-Ah, she kills Bill.

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.827 line:0%
She does kill Bill.
[ Ding! ]

00:04:21.827 --> 00:04:23.762 line:0%
-Yes. "Kill Bill."
-I think we get that one.

00:04:23.762 --> 00:04:24.964
I think we get that one.

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:28.334
-Five is the magic number!

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:29.402
Tom --
-Thank you, man.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:30.903
That was really fun.
I enjoyed that.

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:32.404
-Thank you, pardsy.

00:04:32.404 --> 00:04:34.974
I'm honored to join you in the
ranks of a true spoiler legend.

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:37.877
